# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.bin as build output. These fixtures are
# test INPUTS: build.zig embeds them as the root source of the composer lib
# tests, so without them a fresh clone cannot compile those tests at all.
!tests/fixtures/*.bin
# Benchmark runs keep what the programs printed (the Experiments contract
# shows its tail); the repo-wide *.log rule would drop it.
!bench/runs/**/stderr-*.log
